tourHistory:
  - >-
    For its third year on the Las Vegas Strip, When We Were Young doubled down
    on nostalgia with a wild high-concept twist: nearly every band on the bill
    performed one of its defining 2000s albums front to back. From
    early-afternoon post-hardcore sets to My Chemical Romance reviving The Black
    Parade in full under the desert night sky, Sunday delivered an entire decade
    of Warped Tour history in twelve hours.
bandNotes:
  - band: My Chemical Romance
    note: >-
