      their only live shows of 2024, directly foreshadowing their 2025 Long Live
      The Black Parade stadium tour.
  - band: Fall Out Boy
    note: >-
      Instead of a single album, delivered an era-spanning "Days of Fall Out
      Past" showcase with surprise Magic 8 Ball deep cuts following 2023’s So
      Much (for) Stardust.
  - band: Underoath & Emery
    note: >-
      Underoath performed They’re Only Chasing Safety (2004) for its 20th
      anniversary, while Emery played their 2004 debut The Weak’s End (with Toby
      Morrell captured in personal photos).
  - band: 'Coheed & Cambria, Jimmy Eat World & A Day to Remember'
    note: >-
